# Rust / Cargo
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock is tracked: this workspace ships binaries and an MSI, so builds
# need to be reproducible and `cargo audit` needs to see the resolution we
# actually tested rather than one CI picks for itself.

